.TH KLYRSHIFT 1 "2026-10-19" "klyrshift 0.2.9" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
klyrshift \- automatic keyboard layout switcher
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B klyrshift
[\fI\-\-lang LOCALE\fR]
\fIcommand\fR
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Klyrshift is an automatic keyboard\-layout switcher.
.PP
Klyrshift is a background daemon: it watches what you type and, when a word was typed in the wrong layout, rewrites it and switches the layout. The command line starts, stops and configures that daemon and inspects its dictionaries. Appending \-\-help to a command prints its reference; klyrshift gui opens the settings window.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h\fR, \fB\-\-help
show this help message and exit
.TP
.B \-\-version
show program's version number and exit
.TP
.B \-\-lang \fILOCALE\fR
output language: auto (from the environment) or one of: ru, en, de, fr, uk
.SH COMMANDS
.SS app\-mode
show or set the mode for one application
.PP
.B app
.br
process name, for example code
.PP
.B mode {auto, manual, hybrid}
.br
mode for this application
.PP
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-clear
remove the application from the list
.RE
.SS collect\-logs
collect a diagnostic archive for an issue
.PP
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-output \fIDIR\fR
directory for the archive (defaults to the home directory)
.RE
.SS config
work with the configuration
.PP
.B config_action {show, edit, reset, path, migrate}
.PP
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
for migrate: show the changes without writing anything
.RE
.SS dict
dictionary of words not to correct
.PP
.B dict_action {list, add, remove, download, import\-file, categories, install, list\-installed, remove\-category, pack, verify, install\-file, uninstall\-file}
.br
list/add/remove — user dictionary; download/import\-file — base extended dictionaries; categories/install/list\-installed/remove\-category — themed dictionaries; pack/verify/install\-file/uninstall\-file — versioned language packages (manifest + sha256)
.PP
.B word
.br
word (add/remove) or language/path (download/import\-file)
.PP
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-lang
language for import\-file/pack when it is not in the file name
.TP
.B \-\-file
additional file for dict pack
.TP
.B \-\-name
package name for dict pack
.TP
.B \-\-kind
package kind for dict pack
.TP
.B \-\-output
where to write the package (dict pack)
.TP
.B \-\-package\-version
package version (dict pack)
.TP
.B \-\-license
package license (dict pack)
.RE
.SS doctor
environment self\-diagnostics
.SS explain
explain the detector decision for a word (read\-only)
.PP
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-text
text to analyze (otherwise read from stdin)
.TP
.B \-\-layout
current layout (otherwise detected)
.RE
.SS export
save settings to a file (JSON)
.PP
.B output
.br
file to back up
.SS fix
correct the text manually
.PP
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-text
text to correct (otherwise read from stdin)
.TP
.B \-\-apply
apply the correction on screen
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
only show the correction without applying anything
.RE
.SS gui
open the graphical interface (GTK4)
.SS hotkeys
show the active hotkeys
.SS import
restore settings from a file (JSON)
.PP
.B source
.br
backup file
.SS install\-autostart
enable autostart
.SS kill
force\-kill a hung daemon (SIGKILL)
.SS learn
learning: statistics, word list, on/off
.PP
.B learn_action {list, promote, forget}
.br
list — show learned words; promote/forget — pin/unpin a word
.PP
.B word
.br
word for promote/forget
.PP
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-on
enable learning
.TP
.B \-\-off
disable learning
.TP
.B \-\-reset
reset the learning counters
.RE
.SS logs
show the daemon log
.PP
.RS
.TP
.B \-n\fR, \fB\-\-lines \fIN\fR
how many recent lines to show (50 by default)
.TP
.B \-f\fR, \fB\-\-follow
follow the log in real time
.TP
.B \-\-level \fILEVEL\fR
show only lines of this level (DEBUG/INFO/WARNING/ERROR)
.RE
.SS mode
show or change the mode (auto/manual/hybrid)
.PP
.B mode {auto, manual, hybrid}
.SS restart
restart the daemon
.SS start
start the daemon
.PP
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-foreground
do not detach into the background
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
analyze without switching the layout or replacing text
.RE
.SS status
show the status
.SS stop
stop the daemon
.SS undo
undo the last correction
.SS uninstall\-autostart
disable autostart
.SS verify
check the file integrity of the installed package
.SS version
show the version
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
A command failed, or the requested action was not possible.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/klyrshift/config.toml
User configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/klyrshift/
Dictionaries, backups and the log.
.SH SEE ALSO
Full documentation: \fBhttps://github.com/Pavel1778/Klyrshift\fR
